Changes
=======

v4.0.3 1 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.1.0.

v4.0.2 7 May 2026
  * Add `openidfilter.ByNameTyped` / `openidfilter.StandardTyped`
    constructors that return `Filter[openid.Token]` directly. The
    existing `ByName` / `Standard` constructors (returning
    `Filter[jwt.Token]`) remain for callers filtering heterogeneous
    `jwt.Token` streams.

v4.0.1 28 Apr 2026
  * Documentation only. Tighten the package-level contract around
    `AsMap` aliasing and the `jwk` kty invariant; spell out the
    `Filter` / `Reject` keep-only/drop inversion. No code changes.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * Initial release. Optional filter and introspection helpers extracted
    from github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 core. Tracks jwx/v4 v4.0.0.
